  2026-03 move pay: model 20.00 PLN, observed 12.00 PLN, difference -8.00 PLN
    matched pay[2026-03] on 2026-03-01: model 20.00 PLN, observed 12.00 PLN, difference -8.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  2026-03 balance: model 32.00 PLN, observed 32.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
