  reading: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: salary
  cut 2026-10-25
q_y (x = charge) [pa = lo]: refused: RUN-PLACE kasa is -5.00 DUK after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-02
  reading: pa = lo
  unfulfilled: charge
  cut 2026-10-25
q_y (x = charge) [pa = hi]: 10.00 DUK
  reading: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: charge
  cut 2026-10-25
