  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-03-15
  from: pad rd:stated[konto] = 90.00 PLN, after save[2026-03] (version rd, source s, locator "saldo"), gap role pad from unexplained, gap -10.00 PLN (pads:rd:konto@after save[2026-03])
  no movement
  pad: konto after save[2026-03], pads:rd:konto@after save[2026-03] of -10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-10
